<title>BELGIUM: UCB sets prov 1997 results release dates.</title>
<headline>UCB sets prov 1997 results release dates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals and pharmaceuticals group UCB set the following provisional dates for 1997 news releases:</p>
<p>    - February 5: provisional 1996 results</p>
<p>    - April 11  : final 1996 results and dividend</p>
<p>    - June 25   : payment 1996 dividend</p>
<p>    - July 30   : first-half 1997 results.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
